# Force LF on every text file. A CRLF shebang breaks direct script execution
# (`/usr/bin/env: 'bash\r': No such file or directory`), and the skills invoke
# their bundled scripts directly. Windows teammates must not be able to
# introduce CRLF by checking out the repo.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicitly binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.tgz binary
